    "连接手机时，请将这个指纹与手机上的授权提示核对一致，再允许连接。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When connecting your phone, check that this fingerprint matches the authorization prompt on your phone before allowing the connection."
