    "开启后，存储桶名称会放在网址中的服务器地址后面。MinIO 等自建服务通常需要开启；其他服务请按提供商说明选择。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, the bucket name appears after the server address in the URL. Usually needed for MinIO and other self-hosted services; follow your provider’s instructions."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启后，存储桶名称会放在网址中的服务器地址后面。MinIO 等自建服务通常需要开启；其他服务请按提供商说明选择。"
