    "会删除 Diskit 保存的位置和登录信息，设备上的文件不受影响。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The location and sign-in information saved by Diskit will be deleted. Files on the device are unaffected."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会删除 Diskit 保存的位置和登录信息，设备上的文件不受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会删除 Diskit 保存的登录信息，网盘里的文件不受影响。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sign-in information saved by Diskit will be deleted. Files in the cloud drive are unaffected."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会删除 Diskit 保存的登录信息，网盘里的文件不受影响。"
