    "使用站点的 WebDAV 地址和账户，确保账户拥有相应存储权限。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use the site’s WebDAV address and account. Make sure the account has access to the storage."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用站点的 WebDAV 地址和账户，确保账户拥有相应存储权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "使用*能传输数据的数据线*，并在手机上**允许**这台 Mac；无线连接需输入手机当前显示的*配对码*。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use *a cable that supports data transfer* and **Allow** this Mac on your phone. For a wireless connection, enter the *pairing code* currently shown on the phone."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用*能传输数据的数据线*，并在手机上**允许**这台 Mac；无线连接需输入手机当前显示的*配对码*。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "使用路径形式访问存储桶": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use Path-Style Bucket Access"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用路径形式访问存储桶"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这种连接方式未经服务商官方支持，可能随时失效。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This connection method isn’t officially supported by the provider and may stop working at any time."
