            "value": "挂载命令失败（退出码 %@），请查看 Diskit 日志。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "文件系统扩展": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "File System Extension"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文件系统扩展"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "无法打开系统设置": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unable to Open System Settings"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法打开系统设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "从手机、相机或部分网盘打开文件时，Diskit 会先把文件下载到这台 Mac，这里显示的就是这些副本。清空不影响原文件；SMB 共享不占用这里的空间。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When opening files from a phone, camera, or some cloud drives, Diskit first downloads a copy to this Mac. The space shown here is used by those copies. Clearing the cache leaves the originals untouched. SMB shares do not use this space."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从手机、相机或部分网盘打开文件时，Diskit 会先把文件下载到这台 Mac，这里显示的就是这些副本。清空不影响原文件；SMB 共享不占用这里的空间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "未启用": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not Enabled"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未启用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "正在检查…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Checking…"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在检查…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "此版本无法使用文件系统扩展，请重新构建并签名 Diskit。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This build cannot use the file system extension. Rebuild and sign Diskit."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此版本无法使用文件系统扩展，请重新构建并签名 Diskit。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请先保存这个位置，再验证挂载。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Save this location before testing the mount."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请先保存这个位置，再验证挂载。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请先在系统设置中启用 Diskit 文件系统扩展。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enable the Diskit file system extension in System Settings first."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请先在系统设置中启用 Diskit 文件系统扩展。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "系统里还登记着另一份 Diskit。请退出其他位置打开的 Diskit，然后重试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS still has another copy of Diskit registered. Quit any other copy of Diskit, then try again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系统里还登记着另一份 Diskit。请退出其他位置打开的 Diskit，然后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请打开系统设置，在登录项与扩展中启用 Diskit。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open System Settings and enable Diskit in Login Items & Extensions."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请打开系统设置，在登录项与扩展中启用 Diskit。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "退出 Diskit 会推出本次挂载的位置，SMB 共享保留。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quitting Diskit ejects locations mounted during this session. SMB shares stay mounted."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "退出 Diskit 会推出本次挂载的位置，SMB 共享保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "正在清空缓存…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Clearing cache…"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在清空缓存…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "填写服务器共享出来的文件夹路径，例如 /volume/share。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enter the path of the folder shared by the server, such as /volume/share."
          }
